   $q$Which statement best explains the relationship between Achebe's idea and the community, as the passage presents it?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Achebe's idea started the nursery, and the community's help allowed it to grow and support the reef.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The community asked Achebe to find a cure for warm water, and the nursery was his final answer.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The community's work mattered more than Achebe's idea, since he could not fix the warming water.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"Achebe ran the nursery alone at first, and the community later replaced it with a better plan.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Achebe's idea started the nursery, and the community's help allowed it to grow and support the reef.$q$, $q$The passage moves from Achebe's experiment to groups along the coast joining in, and ends by saying the idea, "shared with a whole community," gave the reef a better chance. Achebe himself says the nursery cannot fix warming water, so it was never presented as a cure.$q$, 'draft', '424826ed-e0dd-5dfd-b1b5-6d447c8dfab4')
